{
  "schema": 1,
  "sourceCommit": "c02b12e878924e722e7e987884ff346f8976284e",
  "original": "<section id=\"talks\" class=\"talks-list\" aria-labelledby=\"talks-title\" data-space-stop=\"talks\">\n  <div class=\"section-heading\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Talks</p>\n    <h2 id=\"talks-title\">Talks &amp; workshops.</h2>\n  </div>\n  <nav class=\"topic-nav\" aria-label=\"Talk language\">\n    <a href=\"#ukrainian-talks\">UA · Ukrainian</a><a href=\"#other-talks\">Other talks &amp; workshops</a>\n  </nav>\n  <h3 id=\"ukrainian-talks\" class=\"writing-topic\">Ukrainian-language talks</h3>\n  <article class=\"publication\" data-language=\"uk\">\n    <div class=\"publication-meta\">\n      <span>PMDay 2026 · Recording in Ukrainian</span><span class=\"language-badge\" lang=\"uk\">UA · Українська</span\n      ><span>Conference talk · <time datetime=\"2026-09-26\">26 September 2026</time></span>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 class=\"talk-title\">AI Changes the Delivery System and the Product Itself</h3>\n      <p>A talk on two connected shifts: how AI changes software delivery, and how model judgment\n        changes the products we build. It explores the implications for requirements, verification,\n        release readiness, operational control, and shared responsibility across the team.</p>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xSgWjuGqC9I?is=Rf9XOk8qrTw8I9aE\"\n        >Watch the recording <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a\n      >\n      <p class=\"edition-link\"><a href=\"https://ua.linkedin.com/posts/pmday_we-are-glad-to-introduce-new-speaker-of-activity-7493632835547889664-67od\">Speaker announcement ↗</a></p>\n      <p class=\"edition-link\"><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/vitaliioborskyi_thank-you-to-the-ua-project-management-day-activity-7510403699689771008-L6yl\">Read the talk summary ↗</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <h3 id=\"other-talks\" class=\"writing-topic\">Other talks &amp; workshops</h3>\n  <article class=\"publication\" id=\"corning\">\n    <div class=\"publication-meta\"> <span>Corning · Learn-AI-Palooza</span><span>Technical workshop</span> </div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 class=\"talk-title\">Designing Non-Deterministic Systems</h3>\n      <p>Invited speaker at Corning’s internal technical AI workshop. Discussed how model-driven\n        systems change architecture, operating models and accountability with the company’s\n        technology community.</p>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/roderickm_one-of-the-highlights-of-our-recent-learn-al-palooza-activity-7480960628980072448-FBm4\"\n        >Host’s public reflection <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a\n      >\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"publication\">\n    <div class=\"publication-meta\"> <span>Betelgeuse · QA Україна</span><span>Community talk</span> </div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 class=\"talk-title\">Uncertainty Architecture &amp; software delivery</h3>\n      <p>A community discussion on AI engineering and QA, connecting practical testing with trust,\n        control, nondeterministic behavior and engineering responsibility.</p>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/posts/vitaliioborskyi_github-uncertaintyarchitecturegroupuncertainty-architecture-activity-7477275989761384448-k8J9/\"\n        >Read the public follow-up <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a\n      >\n      <p class=\"edition-link\"><a href=\"https://ua.linkedin.com/posts/vitaliioborskyi_%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%B8%D1%80-%D0%B4%D1%8F%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%8E-%D0%B7%D0%B0-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%82-%D0%B2%D1%96%D0%BD-%D1%83%D0%B2%D1%96%D0%BC%D0%BA%D0%BD%D1%83%D0%B2-%D1%83-activity-7479802249829928961-PmrF\">Read the discussion reflection ↗</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <article class=\"publication\">\n    <div class=\"publication-meta\"> <span>swarchua · Ukrainian architects community</span><span>Community discussion</span> </div>\n    <div>\n      <h3 class=\"talk-title\">Discussion: Operating AI systems</h3>\n      <p>A discussion with the swarchua architects community on operationalizing AI, runtime\n        uncertainty and the control responsibilities of LLM-based systems.</p>\n      <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1MPsDi3wuF4\"\n        >Watch the recording · AI discussion <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a\n      >\n      <p class=\"edition-link\"><a href=\"https://ua.linkedin.com/posts/vitaliioborskyi_software-architecture-activity-7477274339411693569-dJhu\">Read the discussion context ↗</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </article>\n  <p class=\"section-note\">\n    <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"index.html#contact\">Invite me to speak</a>\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"section-note\">For talks and workshops on AI-assisted delivery, agentic systems and operational responsibility.</p>\n</section>\n",
